<p class="wp-block-paragraph">I did also go on to write a compiler for an 8031 called BPL (Boz&#8217;s Programing Language &#8211; go figure!) it was a  weird cross between Turbo Pascal 1.0, BASIC and C. Unfortunately I have not seen it for about 15 years, but I will find it one day.</p>



